      "text": "When \\(y=-8,\\) the right side is \\(5^0=1.\\) Therefore \\[ 8\\cdot2^x=2^{x+3}=1=2^0, \\] so \\(x+3=0\\) and \\(x=-3.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is B.",
